{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202615WaV5shJc1793194473.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳洲向中國歸還兩件宋皇陵流失文物。</p><p></p><p>國家文物局副局長唐煒、中國駐澳洲大使劉勁松、澳洲國家美術館館長米採維奇等在坎培拉出席歸還接收儀式。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AUS.CN.RELICS 1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202610vMIjQHo91793194481.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>澳洲歸還的文物分別是北宋皇陵武官像頭部，以及永昌陵文官像頭部，兩件文物皆來自中國河南省，材質為石灰岩。中方表示，推動流失文物返還，是維護各國文物安全、守護人類文明成果的正義之舉。澳方表示，歸還文物體現了對文化遺產的尊重，有助深化澳中友好關係。</p><p></p><p>中澳兩國2009年簽署關於文物保護的諒解備忘錄，澳洲國家美術館在2021年完成調查及溯源後，最終將兩件文物歸還。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:50.204628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.473177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:27.108966+00:00","content_hash":"16664d301ff018f29bd160e128cbc3fdd38a8d44cffd014f3d7c47a5e3e8edc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:50.204628+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}